From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:16:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 144/148] [ae-patch] Keep merges and deploys in the action dock
 while their card is on screen

The dock hid an item whenever any part of its own card was visible in the feed,
so a chat with several pull requests ready showed one at a time and its lead
changed as the user scrolled. Only a question now hides while its card is in
view, since that card floats just above the dock; every other item stays,
wherever the feed is scrolled. ConfirmMerge disables Confirm while any merge of
the same pull request is in flight, since the card and the dock can both show it.
